Created `Services/FileSystemWrapper.cs` — a decorator that implements `IFileSystem` and delegates every property to an inner instance. All members are `virtual`, so you can subclass and override specific parts to add logging, retries, caching, or any other cross-cutting behavior:

```csharp
public class LoggingFileSystem : FileSystemWrapper
{
    public LoggingFileSystem(IFileSystem inner) : base(inner) { }

    public override IFile File
    {
        get { /* add logging, then return base.File */ }
    }
}
```

For production, pass `new FileSystem()` as the inner instance; for tests, pass a `MockFileSystem`.
